Upstream: https://github.com/phoboslab/pl_mpeg
Revision: c871f2be022ece7ef4f64230b4fb8e1fb9eb6023
Single-header decoder for browser import tools. Local changes:
- Accept legal MP2 bitrate and channel-mode changes at frame boundaries;
  the shared importer independently validates frame sizes and sync.
- Bound video slices at their next start code, report malformed VLCs and
  macroblocks with plm_video_get_corrupt_slices(), and initialize frame storage
  deterministically. Import rejects a nonzero corruption count; resynchronizing
  the parser does not qualify the resulting pixels as repaired media.
- Check two-dimensional motion bounds including half-pel neighbor reads.
- Preserve caller-owned FIXED_MEM input instead of compacting it in place.
- Replace a negative signed left shift in DC coefficient decoding with the
  equivalent multiplication.
The libdragon fork remains the N64 decoder; it depends on RSP facilities.
